{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c97f51c6-a5b6-8c76-b5ad-db199a74aa1b",
  "created_at": "2026-01-30T14:20:58-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:19:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:19:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I've got a stray dog running around my street. Who do I call about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:19:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let me make sure I have this right. A loose dog, no one with it, in your neighborhood. Is that correct?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Medium-sized, brown, no collar that I can see. It's been out there two days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:19:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two days. Alright. That would go to animal control. I can take down the details and send them over, or I can give you the line to call them directly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Who actually responds? An officer, or the police, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's an animal control officer, generally. If the dog seems dangerous or is in traffic, the police dispatch can step in sooner. Is it acting aggressive at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Just wandering. Seems hungry, mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, then I'll put it in as a stray, non-emergency. Can I get a callback number in case the officer has questions?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight nine. Got it. And the street, so they know where to look?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather not say it over the phone. Just note the call and have them ring me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note that. Sorry for the wait, we've had a lot of calls come in this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, this office sounds busier than I figured. Anyway, thanks. That's all I need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-30T14:20:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Fortes. Have a good weekend."
    }
  ],
